ka8BHTs8G3cQ3YcHCMQBKAA"],[["M:/g/11pqknsctp"],"白湯叉燒拉麵 大",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjA_L31wdKWAxWFka8BHTs8G3cQ3YcHCMUBKAE"],[["M:/g/11swzc35dp"],"日式炸雞 半份",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjA_L31wdKWAxWFka8BHTs8G3cQ3YcHCMYBKAI"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjA_L31wdKWAxWFka8BHTs8G3cQ3IcHCMMBKA0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["🍜 阿莎力拉麵 － 福岡屋拉麵 🍜\n\n西湖這邊是餐飲界的一級戰區\n今天要介紹一間老字號的拉麵店\n靠著獨門的手藝成為街坊吃拉麵首選\n那就是福岡屋拉麵！\n\n🍜 用餐環境\n內用位置有分為一樓和地下室\n有提供免費茶水\n\n🍜 特色餐飲\n白湯：是我最常點的湯頭，有玉米粒提味好喝。\n叉燒：原肉切片相較日式叉燒更為滑嫩，必點！\n炸雞：炸雞不是裹粉炸雞，口味清爽！\n超級炸豆腐：豆腐大塊炸的外酥內嫩，\n是店內的特色小菜，來到店裡面用餐必點！\n\n以上推薦給各位～ 💯💯💯",null,[0,32]]]],[],[null,null,8803,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMlRHSndkamswYzBWNlpreE1Oa1Z5TlRCb00yYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb3282d038bb9a68a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmo2TGJwdjk0c0V6ZkxMNkVyNTBoM2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMlRHSndkamswYzBWNlpreE1Oa1Z5TlRCb00yYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMlRHSndkamswYzBWNlpreE1Oa1Z5TlRCb00yYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMlRHSndkamswYzBWNlpreE1Oa1Z5TlRCb00yYxILMGNjWENVSGtLUTgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tbzJUR0p3ZGprMGMwVjZaa3hNTmtWeU5UQm9NMmMSCzBjY1hDVUhrS1E4IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARiqa5iwMtKLMqCzBjY1hDVUhrS1E4\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjA_L31wdKWAxWFka8BHTs8G3cQoykIxwEoDg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwi3t8X1wdKWAxXunMAFHQ9sJP0Q0pMFCGUoBA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjA_L31wdKWAxWFka8BHTs8G3cQ0pMFCKwBKAQ"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM1ekpfR0lBEAE",["0x0:0xb3282d038bb9a68a",null,1697038788577883,1752374120345529,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111195203129235349309/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Zoey Hsu","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOIe-itcVkIoN6_T2aGW5qlKhDenqb6TXs1ZdoO-6BjBLy8wGq5g\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111195203129235349309?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"11119520312